WEBVTT

00:06:59.257 --> 00:07:01.787
Morate se posvetovati in komunicirati

00:07:01.787 --> 00:07:04.533
z lesom.

00:07:04.533 --> 00:07:06.225
Vsako vlakno v lesu

00:07:06.225 --> 00:07:09.051
ima svoj namen in funkcijo,

00:07:09.051 --> 00:07:12.446
in samo skozi sodelovanje
in harmonijo med njimi

00:07:12.446 --> 00:07:16.043
nastane izjemen lok.

00:07:16.043 --> 00:07:17.833
Morda sem res nenavaden študent

00:07:17.833 --> 00:07:20.024
z nekonvencionalnimi interesi,

00:07:20.024 --> 00:07:22.966
ampak upam, da prispevam s tem,

00:07:22.966 --> 00:07:26.855
ker z vami delim svojo zgodbo.

00:07:26.855 --> 00:07:29.108
Zame je idealni svet kraj,

00:07:29.108 --> 00:07:31.321
kjer nikogar ne pustimo za sabo,